      },
      "message": "Reference Model: Fix NAPOT range not consider entry granularity\n\nAccording to the spec, when granularity G>=2 and the mode is NAPOT,\nentry address bits [G-2:0] are read as all ones. Apply this rule when\ngenerating start address and end address during transaction checking.",
